## Tools

The versions pinned in the Framework's `package.json` and `package-lock.json`:
TypeScript 6.0.3 (typescript-eslint 8.71.0 supports `<6.1.0`, so not 7.x),
ESLint 10.11.0, @eslint/js 10.0.1, typescript-eslint 8.71.0, Prettier 3.9.9,
vitest 5.0.3, esbuild 0.28.2, @types/node 24.19.1, aws-cdk-lib 2.273.0,
constructs 10.8.1, aws-cdk (the CLI) 2.1145.0, cdk-nag 3.0.2, tsx 4.23.15,
@aws-sdk/client-dynamodb 3.1150.0, @aws-sdk/lib-dynamodb 3.1150.0. The
`Dockerfile` builds on `node:24-alpine`. The `Makefile` runs cfn-lint 1.57.2 with uv. The
CDK Nag rules these docs name were read from cdk-nag 3.0.2's `RULES.md`, and
`cdk.json`'s feature flags are the ones `cdk init` of aws-cdk 2.1145.0 writes.
The operations add cdk-monitoring-constructs 10.3.2 (the alarms and the
dashboard); OpenTelemetry JS's `api` 1.9.1, `sdk-trace-node` 2.12.0,
`resources` 2.12.0, `exporter-trace-otlp-http` 0.223.0 and
`instrumentation-http` 0.223.0 (releases v2.12.0 and experimental/v0.223.0,
2026-10-06); and the AWS Distro for OpenTelemetry collector v0.50.0
(2026-08-31), whose image has arm64 and holds `/etc/ecs/ecs-xray.yaml`.

